│  3   Zero                                                                                        │
│  2   One                                                                                    aaaa │
│  1   Two more                                                                               t001 │
│  4 ⧗ New dep:t001                                                                           t002 │
│  1   Three                                                                                       │
│                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                  │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
 NORMAL  todo.txt  manual  3 changed meanwhile and got id:t001; 4 added as id:t002: New       9.9.9
